      "amount": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and sauté until they start to crackle, about 30 seconds.",
    "Stir in garlic, ginger, and green chilies. Cook for another minute.",
    "Add tomatoes, cherry tomatoes, coriander powder, turmeric powder, and salt. Stir well.",
    "Simmer the mixture covered on low heat until most of the liquid has evaporated.",
    "Increase heat to medium and add black pepper flakes. Mix well and cook for 2 minutes more.",
    "Serve hot with chapathi or naan."
  ],
